      "id": 1,
      "text": "Buona Vista’s name means “good view” in Italian, reflecting the area’s scenic outlook.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.streetdirectory.com/travel_guide/singapore/singapore_district/1049/buona_vista.php",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood was developed by HDB in the early 1970s as Queenstown’s sixth housing estate, with its first flats balloted in July 1973.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.streetdirectory.com/travel_guide/singapore/singapore_district/1049/buona_vista.php",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Buona Vista MRT station opened on the East‑West Line and became an interchange with the Circle Line in 2010, linking the estate to the city.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buona_Vista",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The hilly, winding North and South Buona Vista Roads cut through Kent Ridge, a favorite route for thrill‑seekers and racers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.streetdirectory.com/travel_guide/singapore/singapore_district/1049/buona_vista.php",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Grassroots Heritage Centre on South Buona Vista Road educates residents about the evolution of people associations and racial harmony.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.streetdirectory.com/travel_guide/singapore/singapore_district/1049/buona_vista.php",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
